+# Version numbering scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Semantic Versioning (SemVer), with version numbers in the form major.minor.patch. A major bump signals breaking changes, a minor bump signals backward-compatible additions, and a patch bump signals backward-compatible fixes, so users can tell from the version number alone what compatibility implications an update carries.
